SUMMARY:Philosophy for everyone: A Journey of Thought from Young to Old
DESCRIPTION:The aim of this meeting is to present philosophy in a simple and accessible way for everyone\, from children to adults\, by highlighting its role in developing critical thinking and broadening one&rsquo\;s understanding of life. The meeting also seeks to bring philosophical concepts closer through an easy approach that helps make philosophy part of everyday dialogue and human thinking. Topics: The concept of philosophy and its importance in developing thinking skills for all ages. How philosophy helps both children and adults understand life and expand their ways of thinking.
